  fhir:ImplementationGuide.description [ fhir:value "FHIR R4 Implementation Guide that represents systemic anti-cancer therapy\n(SACT) regimens as executable knowledge artifacts (PlanDefinition,\nActivityDefinition, MedicationKnowledge, Library, CodeSystem, ConceptMap).\nCatalog-layer companion to the HL7 Europe Cancer Common Model (PHOENIX) and\nthe German MII Onkologie module. First content source: the HemOnc Knowledge\nBase (HemOncKB). Developed in cooperation with HL7 Europe PHOENIX, HemOnc.org,\nOHDSI Oncology and MII Onkologie. CC BY 4.0.\n"] ;
