       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.description [ fhir:value "CQL library providing BSA (Mosteller/Du Bois/Haycock), Cockcroft-Gault GFR, Calvert carboplatin formula, and per-sig dose helpers referenced by ActivityDefinition.dynamicValue. Phase 0 spike — covers paclitaxel and carboplatin only. Institution policy (BSA formula, BSA cap, GFR formula, GFR cap) is set via $apply Parameters." ] ;
